00:30:01,740 --> 00:30:04,530
克莱尔正试图解决
Clare is trying to solve the vast mystery

536
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,440
失踪宇宙的重大秘密
of the missing Universe.

537
00:30:12,550 --> 00:30:14,540
我们不妨想想太阳
So,if we think about the Sun,

