00:30:26,630 --> 00:30:28,290
因此 在太阳中心
So,in the center of the Sun,

544
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:30,020
质量正在转化为能量
mass is being turned into energy,

545
00:30:30,140 --> 00:30:32,460
那就是通过阳光传送给
and that's what's transmitted by the light

546
00:30:32,570 --> 00:30:34,900
我们地球的东西
here to us on Earth.

547
00:30:35,010 --> 00:30:36,300
所以说 太阳送来的能量
So,the energy from the Sun

548
00:30:36,410 --> 00:30:38,270
我们已经了如指掌了
we know and we understand very well,

549
00:30:38,380 --> 00:30:40,300
但似乎还有另一种能量
but it seems like there's another form of energy

550
00:30:40,410 --> 00:30:42,170
来自宇宙 叫做暗能量
out there in the Universe called dark energy

551
00:30:42,280 --> 00:30:43,700
我们一点都不了解
that we don't understand at all.

552
00:30:43,820 --> 00:30:47,170
公认的物理定律规定
Accepted laws of physics dictate

553
00:30:47,290 --> 00:30:50,640
大爆炸后的宇宙膨胀
that the expansion of the Universe after the Big Bang

554
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:52,780
应该逐渐慢下来
should be slowing down.

555
00:30:52,890 --> 00:30:56,280
但是最近的天文观察发现
But recent astronomical observations have revealed

556
00:30:56,400 --> 00:31:01,320
膨胀正在急剧加速
that the expansion is rapidly speeding up.

557
00:31:01,430 --> 00:31:07,730
某种不明的能量正在把星系推开
Some unexplained form of energy is pushing galaxies apart.

558
00:31:07,840 --> 00:31:09,100
此时
So,at the moment,

559
00:31:09,210 --> 00:31:11,170
我在往前移动 尽管我没有任何动作
l'm moving forward even though l'm not doing anything

560
00:31:11,280 --> 00:31:12,770
那是因为重力
because of the force of gravity.

561
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:13,930
但如果我是在太空里
But if l were in space,

562
00:31:14,050 --> 00:31:15,940
那里没有任何力量作用于我
where there are no forces acting on me,

563
00:31:16,050 --> 00:31:17,600
我根本就不该移动的
l shouldn't be moving at all.

564
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:19,010
如果我向前移动
lf l'm moving forwards,

