00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:21,980
那就必定有什么很奇怪地作用于我
then there has to be something very strange acting on me,

566
00:31:22,090 --> 00:31:23,740
这就是我们所谓的暗能量
and this is what we call dark energy.

567
00:31:23,860 --> 00:31:28,250
宇宙中有多少是暗能量呢？
How much of the Universe is dark energy?

568
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:30,020
这么说吧
Put it this way.

569
00:31:30,130 --> 00:31:32,020
这是宇宙
Here's the Universe.

