00:31:32,130 --> 00:31:38,130
这一片 4.6% 我们能看见的左右的物质
This sliver,4.6%,is all the matter we can see.

571
00:31:38,310 --> 00:31:40,890
几乎无质量的粒子叫做中微子
Near-massless particles called neutrinos

572
00:31:41,010 --> 00:31:44,330
占了另外的0.4%
take up another 0.4%.

573
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:48,040
我们认为那个叫做暗物质的东西
We think that something called dark matter

574
00:31:48,150 --> 00:31:51,510
占了另外的23%
accounts for another 23%.

575
00:31:51,620 --> 00:31:57,180
暗能量则是余下的72%的
Dark energy is the remaining 72%

576
00:31:57,290 --> 00:32:02,650
宇宙的质量和能量
of the mass and energy of the Universe.

577
00:32:02,760 --> 00:32:07,790
我们对它看不见 摸不着 闻不到 甚至测不到
We cannot see it,touch it,taste it,or detect it,

578
00:32:07,900 --> 00:32:12,170
但宇宙学家肯定它存在
but cosmologists are certain it is there.

579
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:18,530
没有暗能量
Without dark energy,

580
00:32:18,650 --> 00:32:23,780
引力将造成宇宙自身的崩塌
gravity would cause the Universe to collapse in on itself.

581
00:32:29,220 --> 00:32:32,710
克莱尔觉得暗能量是物理学里
Clare suspects that dark energy is a by-product

582
